  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 7506.09 Default of Periodic Payment",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7506.09 Default of Periodic Payment. If a default of payment occurs, the division shall mail a letter to the license holder at the address on file and the provisions of RSA 264:12 and Saf-C 7505.09 shall apply.\n\nSource. #13938, eff 4-24-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 7500)",
